+<div class="s-item"><span class="kit-provenance-label__root" data-provenance="written" data-comp="provenance-label · primitive · each value"><span class="kit-provenance-label__label"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-pen-line lucide-edit-3 kit-provenance-label__icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M13 21h8"></path><path d="M21.174 6.812a1 1 0 0 0-3.986-3.987L3.842 16.174a2 2 0 0 0-.5.83l-1.321 4.352a.5.5 0 0 0 .623.622l4.353-1.32a2 2 0 0 0 .83-.497z"></path></svg><span>written</span></span><span class="kit-provenance-label__meaning">by David or the main session</span></span><p class="s-item-text">Text authored by a person or the main session carries this label. Read it as a claim made by its author, not as a measurement.</p></div>
