+<p class="s-text">Everything on this site was compiled once, from one commit. Nothing here is newer than the stamp.</p>
+<div class="kit-markdown-text__root" data-markdown="rendered" data-comp="markdown-text · pattern · pop"><p><strong>Snapshot compiled from origin/main b394466.</strong></p><ul><li>Commit: <code>b394466f9e89d823fbe13a904ab45296d782b033</code> on <code>origin/main</code></li><li>Time: <code>2026-10-19T17:45:08Z</code>, shown as 2026-10-19 17:45:08 UTC</li><li>The ui plan is read from <code>origin/ui</code> at <code>64e52cf3e4ac4ad4efdd9fead4befe0b71118b8d</code></li></ul><p><strong>What the snapshot holds.</strong> 5 plans, counted from plans in trace.json:</p><ul><li><code>build</code>, the API build plan: approved, by David Morgan on 2026-10-17, 10 nodes.</li><li><code>inv-001</code>, F2 attempt-3 escalation: parent build/F2, created 2026-10-18. No status recorded.</li><li><code>inv-002</code>, F5 what-if still precedes the prod approval: parent build/F5, created 2026-10-19. No status recorded.</li><li><code>inv-003</code>, F6 docs state claims the repo does not prove: parent build/F6, created 2026-10-19. No status recorded.</li><li><code>ui</code>: design stage, no DAG yet. No title recorded.</li></ul></div>
