+<div class="kit-markdown-text__root" data-markdown="rendered" data-comp="markdown-text · pattern · pop"><ul><li><code>docs/trace/ui/</code>: the ui plan is read from origin/ui (64e52cf); it is not on origin/main yet.</li><li><code>docs/trace/harness.json</code>: not at origin/main; the harness index was generated from .claude/ instead (DATA-7).</li></ul></div>
