+<article class="kit-finding-card__card" aria-labelledby="fc-d2-i3" data-testable="true" data-fixed="true" data-comp="finding-card · project · testable"><h3 id="fc-d2-i3" class="kit-finding-card__title"><span class="kit-finding-card__id">I3</span><span class="kit-status-tag__tag kit-status-tag__pass" data-status="pass"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check kit-status-tag__icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span>Fixed</span></span><span class="kit-finding-card__testable"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-flask-conical kit-finding-card__icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M14 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 .245.96l5.51 10.08A2 2 0 0 1 18 22H6a2 2 0 0 1-1.755-2.96l5.51-10.08A2 2 0 0 0 10 8V2"></path><path d="M6.453 15h11.094"></path><path d="M8.5 2h7"></path></svg><span>Testable</span></span></h3><dl class="kit-finding-card__fields"><div class="kit-finding-card__field"><dt>Symptom</dt><dd>End_date_is_start_plus_one_year_minus_one_day (SellTermLengthTests.cs:21-30) and Sale_creates_one_term_numbered_1_with_the_calculated_end_date (:34-46) are red on the stub today, but a canned stub could satisfy them.</dd></div><div class="kit-finding-card__field"><dt>Cause</dt><dd>they sell only the builder defaults, and they assert values a fixed body can hold. The defaults at SellPolicyRequestBuilder.cs:12-21 are Household, start TestClock.Today+15 = 2026-11-01, 365.00, autoRenew true, '1 High St' and 'M1 1AA'. They match the canned body at PoliciesController.cs:25-30 field for field. They also match the contract's PolicyResponse example in .claude/skills/architecture/api.md:111-118, whose endDate is 2027-10-31 and whose term 1 is 2026-11-01 to 2027-10-31 for 365.00. These tests are red now only because the stub's PolicyResponse has no endDate or terms (PolicyResponse.cs:4-10). A stub canned from the contract example would turn them green without computing any end date. The same cause is in I4, I5 and I6, but each is reported against its own rule. The other SELL-3 tests (:51-60 1 Mar 2027, :65-75 29 Feb 2028) use non-default starts, so they do discriminate. Rule: 'End date = start + 1 year − 1 day, calculated, cover inclusive.'</dd></div><div class="kit-finding-card__field"><dt>Files</dt><dd><a class="kit-file-line-link__link" href="https://github.com/dpmorgandev/uinsure-policies-api/blob/main/tests/Uinsure.Policies.Api.Tests/SellTermLengthTests.cs" aria-label="tests/Uinsure.Policies.Api.Tests/SellTermLengthTests.cs on GitHub" data-line="absent" data-comp="file-line-link · primitive · line absent"><span class="kit-file-line-link__text">tests/Uinsure.Policies.Api.Tests/SellTermLengthTests.cs</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link kit-file-line-link__icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg></a> <a class="kit-file-line-link__link" href="https://github.com/dpmorgandev/uinsure-policies-api/blob/main/tests/Uinsure.Policies.Api.Tests/Builders/SellPolicyRequestBuilder.cs" aria-label="tests/Uinsure.Policies.Api.Tests/Builders/SellPolicyRequestBuilder.cs on GitHub" data-line="absent" data-comp="file-line-link · primitive · line absent"><span class="kit-file-line-link__text">tests/Uinsure.Policies.Api.Tests/Builders/SellPolicyRequestBuilder.cs</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentCol