nt, though the request sends policyholders and paymentMethod (SellPolicyRequestBuilder.cs:86-87), so the stored policyholders and payment are not shown to round-trip. Buy_to_let_policy_without_auto_renew_reads_back_as_sold (:46-55) sells non-canned values for the two fields it checks, so it does discriminate.</dd></div><div class="kit-finding-card__field"><dt>Files</dt><dd><a class="kit-file-line-link__link" href="https://github.com/dpmorgandev/uinsure-policies-api/blob/main/tests/Uinsure.Policies.Api.Tests/SellRoundTripTests.cs" aria-label="tests/Uinsure.Policies.Api.Tests/SellRoundTripTests.cs on GitHub" data-line="absent" data-comp="file-line-link · primitive · line absent"><span class="kit-file-line-link__text">tests/Uinsure.Policies.Api.Tests/SellRoundTripTests.cs</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link kit-file-line-link__icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg></a></dd></div><div class="kit-finding-card__field"><dt>Fix direction</dt><dd>make the plumbing test sell non-default values for every field and read back all of them. That covers type, startDate, endDate (as a literal), amount, autoRenew, all four property lines, every policyholder in order, the single term 1 and the single payment with the sold method and amount. It is the natural home for the shared read-back assertion described in I1.</dd></div><div class="kit-finding-card__field"><dt>Suggested test</dt><dd><span class="kit-finding-card__absent">not recorded in the excerpt</span></dd></div><div class="kit-finding-card__field"><dt>Fixed by</dt><dd><span class="kit-finding-card__fix"><span class="kit-sha-link__wrap" data-state="pop"><a class="kit-sha-link__sha kit-sha-link__link" href="